        "message": "Set running before any watchdog thread starts (series-11 trial 000-off)\n\nThe first trial on the actually-rebuilt watchdog failed with the armed\nsession expiring at its 5 s first-command timeout and\nreceived_packets=0 on every status row: the lease listener's\nwhile(running) entry check saw running==false and exited instantly \u2014\na pre-existing startup race that the sender thread's creation between\nthe listener's start and the flag widened enough to flip. running is\nnow set before any thread starts. Series-11's failed trial retained."
